  "bandwidth_model": "ch06 model_bytes counts the traffic each phase must move by construction, not by counter sampling \u2014 the pipeline has no data-dependent probe loops. pack: n*3 read + n/8 write. count: n/8 read. emit: n/8 read + runs*12 write. merge: runs*(12 read + union RMW 8 each). flatten: runs*8. paint: runs*12 read + red_px*3 write. The dominant terms are exactly two: the full-resolution read (n*3 in the rgb contract, n/8 in the mask contract) and the paint write (red_px*3). Derived lower-bound model as in every prior chapter; 32 B sectors inflate, L2 deflates; compare only against the measured copy peak.",
